<div class="fullscreen-message">
  <p class="link-with-icon fullscreen-message__header">
    <i class="fa fa-info-circle fa-2x link-with-icon__icon link-with-icon__icon--above"></i>
    You already have an API key
  </p>
  <p class="fullscreen-message__body">
    An active API account already exists for <%= @api_user.email %>.
    You do not need to submit another request.
  </p>
  <p class="fullscreen-message__body">
    Your API token was sent to this address when your request was approved.
    Please check your inbox and spam folder for an email titled
    “Your Protected Planet API token”.
  </p>
  <p class="fullscreen-message__body">
    If you cannot find it or need a new token, please contact
    <a href="mailto:protectedareas@unep-wcmc.org">protectedareas@unep-wcmc.org</a>.
  </p>
</div>
